er role permissions')\n test('should update team status when all players verified')\n test('should create audit trail for verification actions')\n})\n\n### 2.3 Match Day Operations Tests\n**File**: `src/server/api/routers/volunteers/__tests__/fixture.test.ts`\n\n**Test Cases**:\ntypescript\ndescribe('Fixture Management API', () => {\n test('should get venue fixtures for assigned volunteer')\n test('should update match scores')\n test('should progress tournament brackets')\n test('should handle match completion workflow')\n test('should enforce venue assignment permissions')\n})\n\n## Phase 3: Integration Tests\n\n### 3.1 User Journey Tests\n**File**: `__tests__/integration/user-journeys.test.ts`\n\n**Test Scenarios**:\ntypescript\ndescribe('Complete User Journeys', () => {\n test('Team Registration Flow', async () => {\n   // 1. User completes profile\n   // 2. Creates team for sport\n   // 3. Gets promoted to captain\n   // 4. Invites players\n   // 5. Team goes to verification queue\n })\n \n test('Verification Workflow', async () => {\n   // 1. Volunteer gets verification queue\n   // 2. Reviews player documents\n   // 3. Approves/rejects players\n   // 4. Team status updates automatically\n })\n \n test('Match Day Operations', async () => {\n   // 1. Teams check in\n   // 2. Match starts\n   // 3. Scores recorded\n   // 4. Tournament progresses\n })\n})\n\n## Phase 4: Component Tests\n\n### 4.1 Critical UI Components\n**Files**: \n- `src/components/ui/__tests__/AdvancedTable.test.tsx`\n- `src/components/volunteer/__tests__/CreateTeamModal.test.tsx`\n- `src/app/[lang]/public/register/team/[sport]/__tests__/page.test.tsx`\n\n## Phase 5: Test Execution & Fix Cycle\n\n### 5.1 Run Tests & Analyze\nbash\n# Run all tests\nnpm test\n\n# Run specific test suite\nnpm test -- teams/management.test.ts\n\n# Run with coverage\nnpm test -- --coverage\n\n### 5.2 Fix Issues Found\n**Common Issues to Address**:\n- TypeScript type errors in API routes\n- Missing validation in tRPC